        {
          "name": "computer_click",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:bdbc31702ebb24cb8238610a57551c4c22b13fbb589b55793c60d35fe6689084",
          "description": "Click something on the real screen, described in words. A vision model finds it and a USB HID mouse clicks it — a real click, with no undo. You will not see the screen: say what you want clicked and read back what happened. If the reply says the target was not found, look at the window list or describe the element differently rather than retrying the same words.",
